    "# Week 3: Agentic AI for Customer Service\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/YOUR_GITHUB/ai-competition/blob/main/03-agentic-ai/agentic_ai.ipynb)\n",
    "\n",
    "**เป้าหมาย:** สร้าง Multi-Agent Customer Service Bot ด้วย Pure Python\n",
    "\n",
    "**Stack:** LangChain + ChromaDB + Claude API (Anthropic)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture:**\n",
    "```\n",
    "User → Router Agent → Specialist Agent → RAG Tool → Response\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 0. Setup"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install langchain langchain-anthropic langchain-community \\\n",
    "             chromadb sentence-transformers anthropic -q\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "# ใส่ API key — ใน Colab ใช้ Secrets (ไอคอนกุญแจ ด้านซ้าย)\n",
    "# os.environ['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY'] = 'sk-ant-...'\n",
    "\n",
    "# ตรวจสอบ\n",
    "import anthropic\n",
    "print('Anthropic SDK:', anthropic.__version__)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. สร้าง Knowledge Base\n",
    "\n",
    "ก่อนมี data จริง → สร้าง sample KB จาก text\n",
    "\n",
    "เมื่อได้ data จาก PEA (km cs) → แค่เปลี่ยน documents ด้านล่าง"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Sample Knowledge Base — จำลอง km cs ของ PEA\n",
    "SAMPLE_KB = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"id\": \"power_outage_1\",\n",
    "        \"content\": \"\"\"การแจ้งปัญหาไฟดับ:\n",
    "        - โทร 1129 ตลอด 24 ชั่วโมง\n",
    "        - แจ้งที่อยู่ที่เกิดปัญหาและหมายเลขผู้ใช้ไฟ\n",
    "        - เจ้าหน้าที่จะตรวจสอบและแก้ไขภายใน 4 ชั่วโมงในเขตเมือง\n",
    "        - สาเหตุทั่วไป: สายไฟขาด, ฟิวส์ขาด, อุปกรณ์ขัดข้อง\"\"\",\n",
    "        \"category\": \"power_outage\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"id\": \"billing_1\",\n",
    "        \"content\": \"\"\"การคำนวณค่าไฟฟ้า:\n",
    "        - อัตรา TOU (Time of Use): ช่วง peak 09:00-22:00 จันทร์-ศุกร์ แพงกว่า off-peak\n",
    "        - ค่าไฟแบบปกติ: คำนวณจาก kWh ที่ใช้ × อัตราค่าไฟตามขั้น\n",
    "        - ค่า Ft (Fuel Adjustment): ปรับทุก 4 เดือน ตามต้นทุนเชื้อเพลิง\n",
    "        - ดูใบแจ้งหนี้ย้อนหลังได้ที่ PEA Smart Plus App\"\"\",\n",
    "        \"category\": \"billing\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"id\": \"billing_2\",\n",
    "        \"content\": \"\"\"ค่าไฟฟ้าเพิ่มขึ้นผิดปกติ:\n",
    "        - ตรวจสอบว่ามีอุปกรณ์ใหม่หรือไม่ (แอร์, เครื่องทำน้ำอุ่น)\n",
    "        - ตรวจสอบมิเตอร์ว่าอ่านค่าถูกต้อง\n",
    "        - ขอให้ PEA ตรวจสอบมิเตอร์ได้ที่สำนักงานหรือ 1129\n",
    "        - กรณีสงสัยมิเตอร์เสีย: ยื่นคำร้องขอเปลี่ยนมิเตอร์\"\"\",\n",
    "        \"category\": \"billing\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"id\": \"new_service_1\",\n",
    "        \"content\": \"\"\"การขอใช้บริการไฟฟ้าใหม่:\n",
    "        - ยื่นคำร้องที่สำนักงาน PEA ในพื้นที่ หรือ Online ที่ pea.co.th\n",
    "        - เอกสารที่ต้องใช้: สำเนาโฉนด/สัญญาเช่า, สำเนาบัตรประชาชน\n",
    "        - ระยะเวลาดำเนินการ: 3-7 วันทำการ\n",
    "        - ค่าธรรมเนียมขึ้นอยู่กับขนาดมิเตอร์ที่ต้องการ\"\"\",\n",
    "        \"category\": \"new_service\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"id\": \"solar_1\",\n",
    "        \"content\": \"\"\"Solar rooftop และการขายไฟคืน PEA:\n",
    "        - ลงทะเบียนโครงการ Solar ที่ pea.co.th\n",
    "        \"\"\"        ,\n",
    "        \"category\": \"solar\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Knowledge Base: {len(SAMPLE_KB)} documents')\n",
    "for doc in SAMPLE_KB:\n",
    "    print(f'  [{doc[\"category\"]}] {doc[\"id\"]}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Vector Database (ChromaDB)\n",
    "\n",
    "**ทำงานอย่างไร:**\n",
    "1. แต่ละ document → แปลงเป็น vector (embedding)\n",
    "2. เก็บใน ChromaDB\n",
    "3. เมื่อ query → แปลง query เป็น vector → หา document ที่ใกล้เคียงสุด"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import chromadb\n",
    "from chromadb.utils import embedding_functions\n",
    "\n",
    "# ใช้ sentence-transformers (free, ไม่ต้อง API key)\n",
    "# model ที่รองรับภาษาไทย\n",
    "embedding_fn = embedding_functions.SentenceTransformerEmbeddingFunction(\n",
    "    model_name='paraphrase-multilingual-mpnet-base-v2'  # รองรับไทย\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# สร้าง ChromaDB (local, in-memory)\n",
    "chroma_client = chromadb.Client()\n",
    "collection = chroma_client.create_collection(\n",
    "    name='pea_knowledge_base',\n",
    "    embedding_function=embedding_fn\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# เพิ่ม documents\n",
    "collection.add(\n",
    "    ids       = [doc['id'] for doc in SAMPLE_KB],\n",
    "    documents = [doc['content'] for doc in SAMPLE_KB],\n",
    "    metadatas = [{'category': doc['category']} for doc in SAMPLE_KB]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Vector DB: {collection.count()} documents indexed')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ทดสอบ RAG — search\n",
    "def search_kb(query, n_results=2, category_filter=None):\n",
    "    \"\"\"ค้นหาใน knowledge base\"\"\"\n",
    "    where = {'category': category_filter} if category_filter else None\n",
    "    results = collection.query(\n",
    "        query_texts=[query],\n",
    "        n_results=n_results,\n",
    "        where=where\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return results['documents'][0]\n",
    "\n",
    "# ทดสอบ\n",
    "docs = search_kb('ไฟดับทำไงดี')\n",
    "print('Query: ไฟดับทำไงดี')\n",
    "print('Found documents:')\n",
    "for d in docs:\n",
    "    print(' ', d[:100], '...')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 3. LLM Setup (Claude)"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from anthropic import Anthropic\n",
    "\n",
    "client = Anthropic()  # อ่าน ANTHROPIC_API_KEY จาก env อัตโนมัติ\n",
    "\n",
    "def call_llm(system_prompt, user_message, model='claude-haiku-4-5'):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    เรียก Claude API\n",
    "    model: claude-haiku-4-5 = เร็ว + ถูก (เหมาะกับ customer service)\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    response = client.messages.create(\n",
    "        model=model,\n",
    "        max_tokens=1024,\n",
    "        system=system_prompt,\n",
    "        messages=[{'role': 'user', 'content': user_message}]\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return response.content[0].text\n",
    "\n",
    "# ทดสอบ\n",
    "test = call_llm(\n",
    "    system_prompt='คุณเป็น customer service ของ PEA ตอบภาษาไทย',\n",
    "    user_message='สวัสดี'\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('LLM test:', test)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 4. Intent Router"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "INTENTS = ['power_outage', 'billing', 'new_service', 'solar', 'general']\n",
    "\n",
    "def classify_intent(user_message):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Router Agent — จำแนก intent ของ user\n",
    "    Returns: intent string\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    system = f\"\"\"จำแนก intent ของข้อความลูกค้า PEA\n",
    "Intent ที่เป็นไปได้: {', '.join(INTENTS)}\n",
    "\n",
    "- power_outage: แจ้งปัญหาไฟฟ้า, ไฟดับ, ไฟกระชาก\n",
    "- billing: สอบถามค่าไฟ, ใบแจ้งหนี้, ชำระเงิน\n",
    "- new_service: ขอใช้บริการใหม่, ย้ายมิเตอร์, เพิ่มขนาดมิเตอร์\n",
    "- solar: solar rooftop, ขายไฟคืน\n",
    "- general: อื่นๆ\n",
    "\n",
    "ตอบด้วย intent เดียวเท่านั้น ไม่ต้องอธิบาย\"\"\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    intent = call_llm(system, user_message).strip().lower()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Validate\n",
    "    if intent not in INTENTS:\n",
    "        intent = 'general'\n",
    "    return intent\n",
    "\n",
    "# ทดสอบ router\n",
    "tests = [\n",
    "    'ไฟดับมา 3 ชั่วโมงแล้ว',\n",
    "    'ค่าไฟเดือนนี้แพงมาก ทำไม',\n",
    "    'อยากติดตั้งโซลาร์เซลล์',\n",
    "    'ขอใช้ไฟใหม่บ้านที่เพิ่งซื้อ'\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Intent Classification:')\n",
    "for t in tests:\n",
    "    intent = classify_intent(t)\n",
    "    print(f'  \"{t}\" → {intent}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 5. Specialist Agents"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def rag_agent(user_message, intent, complaint_id=None):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Specialist Agent — ดึง context จาก KB แล้วตอบ\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Parameters:\n",
    "        user_message: คำถามจาก user\n",
    "        intent: จาก router\n",
    "        complaint_id: ถ้ามี → ดึงสถานะแจ้งซ่อม (จาก 1129 data)\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # 1. ดึง context จาก KB\n",
    "    category = intent if intent != 'general' else None\n",
    "    context_docs = search_kb(user_message, n_results=2, category_filter=category)\n",
    "    context = '\\n\\n---\\n\\n'.join(context_docs)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 2. Tool: ดึงสถานะ complaint (จำลอง)\n",
    "    complaint_info = ''\n",
    "    if complaint_id:\n",
    "        complaint_info = f'\\n\\nสถานะการแจ้งซ่อม #{complaint_id}: กำลังดำเนินการ คาดว่าแล้วเสร็จ 14:00 น.'\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 3. สร้าง prompt\n",
    "    system = f\"\"\"คุณเป็น customer service ของ PEA (Provincial Electricity Authority)\n",
    "ตอบภาษาไทย กระชับ ชัดเจน เป็นมืออาชีพ\n",
    "\n",
    "ข้อมูลอ้างอิง:\n",
    "{context}\n",
    "{complaint_info}\n",
    "\n",
    "ถ้าไม่มีข้อมูลเพียงพอ → แนะนำให้โทร 1129\"\"\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return call_llm(system, user_message)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def handle_customer(user_message, complaint_id=None):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Main entry point — Router + Specialist\"\"\"\n",
    "    print(f'User: {user_message}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    intent = classify_intent(user_message)\n",
    "    print(f'Intent: {intent}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    response = rag_agent(user_message, intent, complaint_id)\n",
    "    print(f'Agent: {response}')\n",
    "    print('---')\n",
    "    return response\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# ทดสอบ end-to-end\n",
    "handle_customer('ไฟดับมา 2 ชั่วโมงแล้ว ต้องทำไง', complaint_id='2024-001234')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 6. Test Suite — วัดผลการทำงาน"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ชุดคำถามสำหรับ evaluate (competition จะมีชุดนี้)\n",
    "TEST_QUESTIONS = [\n",
    "    {'question': 'ไฟดับ ต้องโทรหาใคร',         'expected_intent': 'power_outage'},\n",
    "    {'question': 'ค่าไฟแพงขึ้นมาก ทำไม',       'expected_intent': 'billing'},\n",
    "    {'question': 'อยากติดโซลาร์เซลล์',          'expected_intent': 'solar'},\n",
    "    {'question': 'บ้านใหม่ขอมิเตอร์ใหม่',       'expected_intent': 'new_service'},\n",
    "    {'question': 'ชำระค่าไฟผ่านแอปได้ไหม',      'expected_intent': 'billing'},\n",
    "    {'question': 'ไฟกระชากบ่อย อันตรายไหม',     'expected_intent': 'power_outage'},\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== Intent Classification Accuracy ===')\n",
    "correct = 0\n",
    "for test in TEST_QUESTIONS:\n",
    "    predicted = classify_intent(test['question'])\n",
    "    ok = predicted == test['expected_intent']\n",
    "    correct += ok\n",
    "    status = '✓' if ok else '✗'\n",
    "    print(f'{status} \"{test[\"question\"]}\"')\n",
    "    if not ok:\n",
    "        print(f'  expected={test[\"expected_intent\"]} | got={predicted}')\n",
    "\n",
    "accuracy = correct / len(TEST_QUESTIONS) * 100\n",
    "print(f'\\nAccuracy: {correct}/{len(TEST_QUESTIONS)} = {accuracy:.0f}%')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 7. เพิ่ม Data จริง (PEA 1129 Complaints)"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def load_pea_complaints_to_kb(csv_path):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    โหลด 1129 complaint data → เพิ่มใน ChromaDB\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Expected CSV columns:\n",
    "        complaint_id, category, description, resolution\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(csv_path)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ids, docs, metas = [], [], []\n",
    "    for _, row in df.iterrows():\n",
    "        doc_text = f\"\"\"ปัญหา: {row['description']}\n",
    "วิธีแก้: {row['resolution']}\"\"\"\n",
    "        ids.append(str(row['complaint_id']))\n",
    "        docs.append(doc_text)\n",
    "        metas.append({'category': row['category']})\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # เพิ่มเป็น batch\n",
    "    batch_size = 100\n",
    "    for i in range(0, len(ids), batch_size):\n",
    "        collection.add(\n",
    "            ids       = ids[i:i+batch_size],\n",
    "            documents = docs[i:i+batch_size],\n",
    "            metadatas = metas[i:i+batch_size]\n",
    "        )\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f'Loaded {len(ids)} complaints into vector DB')\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def load_km_cs_to_kb(folder_path):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    โหลด km cs documents (PDF/TXT) → เพิ่มใน ChromaDB\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    from langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader, TextLoader\n",
    "    from langchain.text_splitter import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n",
    "    \n",
    "    loader = DirectoryLoader(folder_path, glob='**/*.txt', loader_cls=TextLoader)\n",
    "    raw_docs = loader.load()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=500, chunk_overlap=50)\n",
    "    chunks = splitter.split_documents(raw_docs)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ids  = [f'km_{i}' for i in range(len(chunks))]\n",
    "    docs = [c.page_content for c in chunks]\n",
    "    metas= [{'source': c.metadata.get('source', '')} for c in chunks]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    collection.add(ids=ids, documents=docs, metadatas=metas)\n",
    "    print(f'Loaded {len(chunks)} km cs chunks into vector DB')\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# ใช้งาน:\n",
    "# load_pea_complaints_to_kb('pea_1129_data.csv')\n",
    "# load_km_cs_to_kb('km_cs_documents/')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Data loading functions ready — รอ data จริงจาก PEA')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "| Component | สิ่งที่ทำ |\n",
    "|-----------|----------|\n",
    "| Knowledge Base | text documents → ChromaDB |\n",
    "| Embedding | `paraphrase-multilingual-mpnet-base-v2` (รองรับไทย) |\n",
    "| RAG | search KB → inject context → LLM |\n",
    "| Router | classify intent ด้วย Claude |\n",
    "| Specialist Agent | ตอบตาม domain + context |\n",
    "| Test Suite | วัด accuracy ของ intent classification |\n",
    "| Data Pipeline | รองรับ 1129 CSV + km cs documents |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**เมื่อได้ data จริง:**\n",
    "1. `load_pea_complaints_to_kb('1129_data.csv')`\n",
    "2. `load_km_cs_to_kb('km_cs/')`\n",
    "3. เพิ่ม test questions จากชุดที่กรรมการให้\n",
    "4. Tune system prompt ตาม domain\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Next: Week 4 — Pitching**"
   ]
  }
 ]
}"
